PR: https://github.com/longyuanai/AI-CodeGuard/pull/17
Node v24.22.0 / npm 11.19.1 via process-local portable PATH; system Node unchanged.
Protected ROADMAP.md / SECURITY.md unchanged and untracked.
No external App registration, paid calls, deployment, merge, publication or APPROVE review.

Review findings:
P1 pipeline.ts original lines 78-81: renamed file with additions but unavailable changed lines was skipped without incomplete; some missing hunks also passed. Fix compares API additions and marks partial, retaining visible findings. Confirmed zero-addition rename/deletion may have no hunks.
P2 diff.ts original lines 66-67: Git C-quoted UTF-8 paths never matched repository filenames; CLI --diff dropped findings and App could not anchor/scan them. Fix decodes Git octal UTF-8 and C escapes in the shared parser.
No unresolved blocking P0/P1/contract P2 found in the reviewed change. Known documented MVP limits retained, not upgraded into queue/multi-tenant features.


